    decision('c0436', 'needs_evidence', 'Ancient Atlantis’s automatic infrastructure does not establish its pre-evacuation household economics.', ['src-atlantis-ancient-reference'], analysis='Protective systems and later expedition access are not evidence of earlier universal entitlement.', follow_up='Skip full-series history reconstruction; reject alternate-universe fanfiction as canon.')
